{
  "name": "@bloombot/web",
  "version": "0.1.0",
  "private": true,
  "description": "The control panel (WEB-1..6): a static bundle served by nginx, talking to apps/api over the same origin. Imports @bloombot/schemas and nothing else from the workspace (PLAT-2) — enforced by eslint.config.js's own no-restricted-imports rule, and checked structurally by tests/bundle.test.ts (WEB-6).",
